  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 15px; word-spacing: 0.015px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239); float: none; display: inline;\">Elevate your wellness routine with the Vendome Living Indoor Far Infrared Wellness Sauna, an expertly crafted sanctuary designed to deliver spa-like relaxation and health benefits from the comfort of your home. Combining premium materials, advanced technology, and user-friendly features, this sauna offers an unparalleled experience in relaxation and rejuvenation.</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px 1.25rem; padding: 0px; list-style-position: outside; line-height: 1.6; list-style-type: disc; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\">Indoor Use, Plug-and-Play Simplicity<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Designed for effortless installation, this sauna connects to a standard 240V AC powerpoint, making setup quick and easy.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Customisable Comfort<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Enjoy complete control over your sauna experience with adjustable climate controls and a wide temperature range of 18-60&deg;C to suit your preferences.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Premium Canadian Hemlock Design<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Encased in sustainably sourced Canadian Hemlock timber, this sauna offers a durable, elegant aesthetic that seamlessly blends into your indoor space.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Quick and Efficient Heating<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Heats up in as little as 8&ndash;12 minutes, allowing you to enjoy the benefits of infrared heat without delay.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Energy-Efficient Operation<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Engineered for minimal power consumption, this sauna provides a sustainable wellness solution.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Smartphone Connectivity<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Adjust settings remotely with smart connectivity, giving you control over temperature, lighting, and sound at your fingertips.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Sublime Sound System<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Immerse yourself in soothing music or guided meditations with the integrated sound system, elevating your relaxation.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Ambient Cabin Lighting<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Create the perfect atmosphere with soft cabin lighting to enhance your sauna experience.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Standalone, Compact Design<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Featuring a sleek, standalone structure with a wooden grab handle for easy entry, this sauna fits effortlessly into any indoor space without the need for major modifications.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Low-Maintenance Upkeep<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Designed for hassle-free cleaning and maintenance, ensuring long-lasting performance with minimal effort.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: calc(var(--font-body-line-height-scale) * 1.6); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; word-spacing: 0.001em; font-feature-settings: 'kern'; font-kerning: normal; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0px 1.25rem; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 34px); line-height: calc(var(--font-heading-line-height-scale) * calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 42px)); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p2\">Infrared Sauna Health Benefits</h3>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: calc(var(--font-body-line-height-scale) * 1.6); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; word-spacing: 0.001em; font-feature-settings: 'kern'; font-kerning: normal; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p1\">The Vendome Living Far Infrared Sauna is more than just a luxury&mdash;it&rsquo;s a commitment to your health and wellbeing. Enjoy a range of scientifically supported benefits, including:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px 1.25rem; padding: 0px; list-style-position: outside; line-height: 1.6; list-style-type: disc; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Boosting the immune system for better overall health.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Enhancing sleep quality and reducing stress for improved mental wellbeing.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Promoting muscle recovery and reducing inflammation for active lifestyles.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Encouraging detoxification to eliminate toxins from the body.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Improving circulation, easing chronic pain, and promoting relaxation.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: inherit;\" class=\"li1\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"s1\"></span>Supporting weight loss and skin rejuvenation with anti-ageing properties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: calc(var(--font-body-line-height-scale) * 1.6); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; word-spacing: 0.001em; font-feature-settings: 'kern'; font-kerning: normal; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0px 1.25rem; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 34px); line-height: calc(var(--font-heading-line-height-scale) * calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 42px)); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p2\">Why Choose a Sauna from Vendome Living?</h3>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: calc(var(--font-body-line-height-scale) * 1.6); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; word-spacing: 0.001em; font-feature-settings: 'kern'; font-kerning: normal; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p1\">With its quick and easy installation, seamless operation, and premium design, the Vendome Living Indoor Far Infrared Wellness Sauna is the ultimate addition to your home. Whether you&rsquo;re seeking relaxation, improved health, or a luxurious escape, this sauna delivers a transformative wellness experience every time.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: calc(var(--font-body-line-height-scale) * 1.6); text-rendering: optimizelegibility; word-spacing: 0.001em; font-feature-settings: 'kern'; font-kerning: normal; color: rgb(44, 44, 44); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 239);\" class=\"p1\">Rediscover relaxation and rejuvenation with the Vendome Living Indoor Far Infrared Wellness Sauna, where modern technology meets timeless design for a healthier, happier you.</p>",
